            <ArticleTitle>Adenomyosis completely encapsulated by muscle-like cavity in the mesorectum: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>409-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of adenomyosis, completely encapsulated and located in the mesentery between the sigmoid colon and rectum, was admitted our hospital. We have reported the symptoms, diagnosis, and treatment of the present case.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
